            "categoryName": "Soups & Stews",
            "region": "Yucatán Peninsula",
            "spice": "Mild / Fragrant Citrus",
            "pronunciation": "SOH-pah deh LEE-mah",
            "description": "Aromatic Mayan chicken soup prepared with fragrant native Yucatecan sweet lima citrus, bell peppers, tomatoes, and shredded chicken breast.",
