            "categoryName": "Soups & Stews",
            "region": "Coasts / Nationwide",
            "spice": "Tangy & Sweet (Ketchup & Lime Base)",
            "pronunciation": "KOHK-tehl deh kah-mah-ROHN ee POOL-poh",
            "description": "Classic Mexican chilled seafood cocktail packed with poached wild shrimp and tender octopus, submerged in a sweet-tangy tomato sauce with lime, hot sauce, and olive oil.",
            "howToEat": "Served in tall glass goblets topped with cubed avocado, fresh cilantro, onions, and saltine crackers (galletas saladas)."
          },
          {
            "id": 1008,
            "dish": "Caldo de Queso",
            "category": "soups",
            "categoryName": "Soups & Stews",
            "region": "Sonora",
