            "region": "Jalisco / Nationwide",
            "spice": "Sweet / Nutty",
            "pronunciation": "mah-sah-PAHN deh kah-kah-WAA-teh",
            "description": "Iconic Mexican peanut candy disk made of crushed roasted peanuts and powdered sugar pressed into a crumbly, melt-in-your-mouth block.",
